<title>POLAND: Merrill buys nearly 8 mln BIG shares.</title>
<headline>Merrill buys nearly 8 mln BIG shares.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International bought 7,999,995 million shares of Bank Inicjatyw Gospodarczych SA (BIG) from Bank Gdanski SA,  Gdanski said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Gdanski must sell all of its BIG shares in order to merge with BIG.</p>
<p>The statement said that Gdanski would sell its remaining five BIG shares on the bourse on August 18.</p>
